$DATUM Methyl [[2-(2-methoxy-2-oxoethoxy)-4-nitrophenyl]thio]acetate (3) A
mixture of 24.1 cm3 methyl thioglycolate (0.27 mol), 61.4 g ester 2 (0.25
mol), 51.7 cm3 Et3N (0.37 mol), and 150 cm3 DMSO was stirred at 80 °C for
4 h. The reaction mixture was cooled to 20 °C and poured into water. The
precipitate was filtered, washed with water and dried. Diester 3 (95 %,
74.8 g). White solid; m.p.: 131- 132 °C (i-PrOH); 1H NMR (DMSO-d6, 400
MHz): δ = 7.83 (dd, J = 8.4, 2.0 Hz, 1H, H-5), 7.68 (d, J = 2.0 Hz, 1H,
H-3), 7.41 (d, J = 8.4 Hz, 1H, H-6), 4.99 (s, 2H, O-CH2), 3.96 (s, 2H,
S-CH2), 3.78 (s, 3H, CH3), 3.70 (s, 3H, CH3) ppm; 13C NMR (DMSO-d6, 100
MHz): δ = 169.2, 168.6, 153.4, 145.3, 135.5, 125.6, 117.1, 106.0, 65.6,
52.6, 52.1, 32.1 ppm; IR (KBr): ν = 1732 (C=O), 1519 (NO2), 1345 (NO2)
cm-1. C12H13NO7S.
